<title>AUSTRALIA: AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$130 mln.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$130 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five promissory note tenders totalling A$130 million hit the Australian commercial paper market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Property and financial services group Lend Lease Corp made the largest issue, selling A$40 million of its 30-day paper at a touch over one basis point above BBSW.</p>
<p>Dealers said short end turnover during the the morning was minimal.</p>
<p>At 0105 GMT (11.05 a.m.), June bill futures were up one point to 93.88.  </p>
